  "id": "hydromodel-xaj-sd-001",
  "primary_skill": "hydrological-modeling/run-semi-distributed-xaj-model",
  "prompt": "Use build_result.json, topology_qc_result.json, forcing.csv, and params.json exactly as supplied to run hydrological-modeling/run-semi-distributed-xaj-model. The HydroBase chain is a hash-checked two-subbasin, two-reach serial network; the forcing is hourly with columns time,sub_id,P_mm,E0_mm (+08:00). Write the native outputs (subbasin_process.csv, reach_process.csv, outlet_flow.csv, model_config.json, result.json) under xaj-sd-run/. Do not modify the topology, parameters, or forcing; validation must not participate in any state update.",
